WEBVTT

00:00:08.110 --> 00:00:14.300
Mobile Suit Zeta Gundam

00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:22.680
aoku nemuru mizu no hoshi ni sotto

00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:22.680
Kissing softly the star of water that sleeps in blue,

00:00:22.680 --> 00:00:31.410
kuchizuke shite inochi no hi wo tomosu hito yo

00:00:22.680 --> 00:00:31.410
A person who lights the fire of life,

00:00:31.410 --> 00:00:36.300
toki to iu kin'iro no sazanami wa

00:00:31.410 --> 00:00:36.300
The time, the golden ripple,

00:00:36.320 --> 00:00:45.070
oozora no kuchibiru ni umareta toiki ne

00:00:36.320 --> 00:00:45.070
is a sigh from the lips of the sky,

00:00:45.070 --> 00:00:49.300
kokoro ni uzumoreta

00:00:45.070 --> 00:00:49.300
The stars of kindness...

00:00:49.300 --> 00:00:52.270
yasashisa no hoshitachi ga

00:00:49.300 --> 00:00:52.270
...buried in heart flame up...

00:00:52.270 --> 00:00:56.440
honoo age yobiau

00:00:52.270 --> 00:00:56.440
...and call to each other,

00:00:56.440 --> 00:01:03.430
namima sasurau nanpasen no you ni

00:00:56.440 --> 00:01:03.430
Like wrecked ships wandering on the waves...

00:01:03.430 --> 00:01:08.870
mou nakanaide ima

00:01:03.430 --> 00:01:08.870
Don't cry, any more,

00:01:08.870 --> 00:01:16.240
anata wo sagashite iru hito ga iru kara

00:01:08.870 --> 00:01:16.240
because now there is a person looking for you,

00:01:16.240 --> 00:01:20.970
omae ni aitai yo to

00:01:16.240 --> 00:01:20.970
Dying to see you...

00:01:30.250 --> 00:01:36.110
Storm Over Kilimanjaro

00:01:39.600 --> 00:01:43.190
The Radish is leaving from Dock Ship
La Vie En Rose...

00:01:43.270 --> 00:01:46.100
...where the Argama is presently
being repaired.

00:01:57.150 --> 00:01:58.880
Bye-bye, Radish.

00:01:58.950 --> 00:02:00.040
Bye-bye!

00:02:00.320 --> 00:02:02.410
- Bye!
- Bye-bye!

00:02:07.560 --> 00:02:10.120
- What's the matter?
- Hey, don't touch it!

00:02:10.190 --> 00:02:13.430
Look, it broke,
all because you kept throwing it!

00:02:13.960 --> 00:02:15.690
It's not my fault!

00:02:15.770 --> 00:02:18.290
Haro is always jumping about!

00:02:18.370 --> 00:02:20.360
Yeah, but still!

00:02:22.710 --> 00:02:24.470
Haro's broken, Kamille!

00:02:25.180 --> 00:02:26.370
Fix it!

00:02:26.440 --> 00:02:28.340
I'm exhausted, and I'm busy.

00:02:28.580 --> 00:02:29.550
You're lying.

00:02:29.610 --> 00:02:33.520
You've hardly done anything
since we docked into La Vie En Rose.

00:02:34.080 --> 00:02:36.280
Did Captain Bright send you here
to spy on me?

00:02:36.550 --> 00:02:37.540
No way.

00:02:37.620 --> 00:02:39.780
You can tell by looking at it. Fix it!

00:02:39.860 --> 00:02:41.190
Not right now!

00:02:41.260 --> 00:02:42.250
Why not?!

00:02:42.330 --> 00:02:45.120
Even I get tired or have things
to think about at times!

00:02:45.300 --> 00:02:46.490
Meany!

00:02:49.000 --> 00:02:53.330
If you don't want the kids to leave this ship,
they'd better hide again.

00:02:53.500 --> 00:02:56.270
Authorities from the La Vie En Rose
will visit us before we depart.

00:02:56.470 --> 00:02:58.200
Yes, I'll see to it.

00:03:03.580 --> 00:03:04.510
Qum, why are you crying?

00:03:04.580 --> 00:03:08.210
He's being mean. He has free time now,
but he refuses to fix Haro.

00:03:08.290 --> 00:03:09.680
Kamille's refusing?

00:03:15.860 --> 00:03:18.020
- All right, then.
- You're so pigheaded!

00:03:26.570 --> 00:03:29.160
- It's going to take me some time!
- Thanks!

00:03:33.380 --> 00:03:34.340
Kamille!

00:03:35.380 --> 00:03:37.370
That was very childish of you!

00:03:37.450 --> 00:03:39.310
I hate kids because they're so
self-centered.

00:03:39.380 --> 00:03:41.280
That's not what I'm talking about!

00:03:41.350 --> 00:03:42.510
What are you so mad about?

00:03:42.950 --> 00:03:46.480
You're not the only one saddened
by the death of Miss Reccoa.

00:03:46.560 --> 00:03:48.390
So don't go taking it out on the children!

00:03:48.560 --> 00:03:51.050
You're even taking it out on the Lieutenant!
It's embarrassing!

00:03:51.130 --> 00:03:52.190
That has nothing to do with it.

00:03:52.260 --> 00:03:54.420
I'm just tired.

00:03:55.570 --> 00:03:56.530
Well, we're re-supplied...

00:03:56.600 --> 00:03:58.570
...but now it's on to Kilimanjaro.

00:03:59.200 --> 00:04:01.100
It's a joint operation with Karaba.

00:04:01.670 --> 00:04:04.570
We've got to follow the timetable
they've set for the operation.

00:04:05.380 --> 00:04:06.870
We'll just have to do it.

00:04:06.940 --> 00:04:09.670
But now that Mr. Wong's
no longer on board with us...!

00:04:09.780 --> 00:04:12.080
- Less stressful?
- Exactly.

00:04:22.630 --> 00:04:24.720
This is the course the Argama will take.

00:04:26.430 --> 00:04:28.230
For Karaba's attack on Kilimanjaro...

00:04:28.300 --> 00:04:31.030
...the Argama will lend them
support from orbit.

00:04:31.100 --> 00:04:32.330
Our mobile suits will be standing by...

00:04:32.400 --> 00:04:36.400
Back to Earth.
Where I met Four Murasame.

00:04:36.470 --> 00:04:38.940
However, we don't plan to send out
our mobile suits.

00:04:39.140 --> 00:04:40.270
Won't we be going down?

00:04:40.380 --> 00:04:42.350
Weren't you listening to me?

00:04:42.480 --> 00:04:43.500
I was listening!

00:04:43.580 --> 00:04:46.280
I'm asking if we'll just watch
the Karaba members get killed?!

00:04:46.820 --> 00:04:48.250
I explained our objectives!

00:04:48.320 --> 00:04:51.450
- Are you scared, Lieutenant?!
- Kamille, stop it!

00:04:51.660 --> 00:04:53.590
Your attitude is what got
Miss Reccoa killed.

00:04:54.160 --> 00:04:56.130
You weren't paying attention at all!

00:04:56.230 --> 00:04:58.250
Kilimanjaro is where the Titans' base is!

00:04:58.330 --> 00:05:01.490
The Argama doesn't have enough
mobile suits to easily capture it!

00:05:05.640 --> 00:05:07.570
I understand why you're angry.

00:05:07.770 --> 00:05:09.760
But Karaba will be sending out
their mobile suits.

00:05:09.840 --> 00:05:12.670
The Argama's main objective will be
to draw Kilimanjaro's attention to space...

00:05:12.740 --> 00:05:13.680
Kamille!

00:05:13.740 --> 00:05:16.470
I understand!
I will go along with the operation!

00:05:23.090 --> 00:05:24.020
Sorry, everyone!

00:05:24.090 --> 00:05:26.080
All units, standby on the mobile suit deck!

00:05:30.790 --> 00:05:33.420
I want to descend to Earth so badly.

00:05:37.130 --> 00:05:40.260
I'm in no position to criticize
Lieutenant Quattro.

00:05:43.810 --> 00:05:46.540
Shinta and Qum.
Say thank you.

00:05:48.580 --> 00:05:50.810
Don't break it again.

00:05:50.880 --> 00:05:52.370
Haro is yours from now on.

00:05:52.820 --> 00:05:54.510
Really?! All right!

00:05:54.590 --> 00:05:55.520
Haro!

00:05:55.590 --> 00:05:57.180
You're so cute!

00:05:57.250 --> 00:05:59.720
Fa, Kamille says he's giving Haro to us.

00:05:59.790 --> 00:06:01.520
Really?! That's great!

00:06:01.860 --> 00:06:03.420
Thank you, Kamille.

00:06:03.490 --> 00:06:04.860
Don't mention it.

00:06:04.930 --> 00:06:07.520
Hey, would you mind looking after
Miss Reccoa's cactus, Fa?

00:06:08.900 --> 00:06:10.700
Not at all. Why?

00:06:10.770 --> 00:06:12.740
No particular reason. Later!

00:06:28.420 --> 00:06:30.050
So these are the Barzams.

00:06:30.120 --> 00:06:32.750
- We sure seem to have a lot of them!
- Yes, sir!

00:06:32.960 --> 00:06:35.620
And the mechanics working on these
are highly qualified!

00:06:35.690 --> 00:06:36.990
I'm enjoying this, Gady.

00:06:38.730 --> 00:06:40.750
Captain, I thank you for your cooperation.

00:06:41.130 --> 00:06:42.830
N-Not a problem.

00:06:42.900 --> 00:06:45.800
Just avoid the anti-air fire from Earth.

00:06:47.500 --> 00:06:49.030
They're not able to differentiate...

00:06:49.110 --> 00:06:51.070
...between enemy and ally from Earth,
are they?

00:06:51.210 --> 00:06:52.180
My point exactly.

00:06:56.610 --> 00:06:59.380
We've ended up letting him use
our Barzam team as well.

00:06:59.450 --> 00:07:02.040
Can that Yazan handle them?

00:07:02.120 --> 00:07:05.150
It doesn't look like Scirocco ordered Yazan
to pursue the Argama...

00:07:05.220 --> 00:07:07.880
...just to get rid of a nuisance.

00:07:09.460 --> 00:07:11.830
Hambrabi team! Barzam team! Ready!

00:07:28.810 --> 00:07:31.040
- How's our course?!
- Satisfactory!

00:07:31.110 --> 00:07:33.450
All mobile suits! Standby for take-off!

00:07:33.520 --> 00:07:35.280
We're synchronizing our clocks!

00:07:38.860 --> 00:07:40.150
<i>Hey, Kamille!</i>

00:07:40.220 --> 00:07:42.160
<i>If you get to Earth,</i>
<i>don't forget to get me a gift!</i>

00:07:42.230 --> 00:07:43.620
I don't intend to land!

00:07:43.690 --> 00:07:45.660
We're only reinforcing the area
from orbit.

00:07:46.030 --> 00:07:47.760
I don't think it'll be that simple. They're...!

00:07:47.830 --> 00:07:49.320
<i>Missiles approaching!</i>

00:07:49.770 --> 00:07:51.730
I see missile tracks from Earth!

00:07:52.200 --> 00:07:53.600
Three! Portside!

00:07:53.670 --> 00:07:55.570
Caesar, from where were they launched?

00:08:00.080 --> 00:08:02.270
The missiles are likely coming from
the Canary Islands!

00:08:02.350 --> 00:08:03.750
Prepare to fire on the Earth's surface!

00:08:03.810 --> 00:08:06.310
Fire ballistic missiles at Kilimanjaro!

00:08:13.020 --> 00:08:14.790
They're coming! Mega particle cannon!

00:08:19.030 --> 00:08:21.330
I see the African continent
along the horizon!

00:08:21.600 --> 00:08:22.900
Watch for anti-air missiles!

00:08:37.910 --> 00:08:40.470
We'll attack when
the anti-air firing subsides.

00:08:40.550 --> 00:08:41.850
Our target is the Zeta only!

00:08:42.550 --> 00:08:45.540
We'll use the Sea Serpent!
Barzams, focus on the others!

00:08:46.260 --> 00:08:48.990
Enemy mobile suits detected!
About ten of them!

00:08:49.390 --> 00:08:50.830
We'll send out our mobile suit team!

00:08:50.890 --> 00:08:52.860
- Let all gun platforms know!
- Yes, sir!

00:08:52.930 --> 00:08:56.390
It's unlikely that missiles from Earth
will hit us! Continue our counterattack!

00:09:00.170 --> 00:09:02.600
Zeta Gundam! Kamille! Taking off!

00:09:09.050 --> 00:09:12.380
Hyaku Shiki, taking off!
All mobile suits, try to keep up!

00:09:16.020 --> 00:09:18.990
They're here! Hambrabi team,
we'll split into two groups!

00:09:21.120 --> 00:09:22.220
Take this!

00:09:28.570 --> 00:09:30.030
What's this?! Something's shining!

00:09:34.740 --> 00:09:36.170
You can't move, Zeta!

00:09:40.010 --> 00:09:40.980
Kamille!

00:09:45.780 --> 00:09:47.910
- Lieutenant!
- Go get your rifle!

00:10:01.430 --> 00:10:02.420
Lieutenant!

00:10:07.800 --> 00:10:09.140
Stop it! You'll free-fall!

00:10:09.210 --> 00:10:11.300
We've already carried out
Scirocco's orders!

00:10:11.370 --> 00:10:12.340
Don't go down in flames!

00:10:12.780 --> 00:10:14.470
The Hyaku Shiki's falling!

00:10:14.540 --> 00:10:16.410
Kamille's chasing it!

00:10:16.480 --> 00:10:18.070
Can you hear me, Kamille?!

00:10:18.250 --> 00:10:21.810
The Hyaku Shiki is out of control
and being pulled by the gravity!

00:10:21.890 --> 00:10:22.940
Join with Karaba!

00:10:23.150 --> 00:10:24.250
You can hear me, right?!

00:10:24.320 --> 00:10:26.980
Anti-air fire!
Defend against enemy mobile suits!

00:10:28.830 --> 00:10:30.690
Did just one hit mess it all up?!

00:10:37.500 --> 00:10:39.200
This is way too fast.

00:10:43.810 --> 00:10:44.770
That's it!

00:10:54.650 --> 00:10:56.920
Be careful not to lean
outside of the shockwave!

00:10:56.990 --> 00:10:57.950
<i>Roger!</i>

00:10:58.090 --> 00:11:00.060
We'll head directly for Kilimanjaro.

00:11:19.680 --> 00:11:21.840
Anti-air mega particle cannon!
Our barrage is weak!

00:11:21.910 --> 00:11:23.680
Mobile suits! Prepare to descend!

00:11:23.880 --> 00:11:25.510
They're coming from straight ahead!

00:11:42.630 --> 00:11:44.260
Kamille. You're doing well.

00:11:46.500 --> 00:11:47.990
We're here.
That's Kilimanjaro.

00:11:50.810 --> 00:11:54.170
Karaba's sent out a significant part
of their force.

00:11:54.640 --> 00:11:56.980
Yet, they're still unable
to take over Kilimanjaro?!

00:12:15.370 --> 00:12:17.560
We'll get out of here!
It's too dangerous!

00:12:17.830 --> 00:12:20.060
Is the Hyaku Shiki still functional?!

00:12:20.370 --> 00:12:22.070
Just a couple dents in the body!

00:12:22.440 --> 00:12:24.130
We'll investigate Kilimanjaro's summit!

00:12:24.810 --> 00:12:28.540
If we're joining Karaba, we might as well
descend to the summit!

00:12:28.910 --> 00:12:31.110
And be hit by a friendly missile?!

00:12:35.220 --> 00:12:36.780
The shape of the mountain...!

00:12:40.460 --> 00:12:43.090
- We're descending!
- <i>Right!</i>

00:12:52.700 --> 00:12:54.470
Are preparations complete?

00:12:54.540 --> 00:12:56.100
It's just about ready!

00:12:56.640 --> 00:12:59.400
- Your Excellency!
- I want to see it once with my own eyes.

00:12:59.480 --> 00:13:01.210
B-But, we're in the middle of a battle.

00:13:01.280 --> 00:13:02.770
That's why I'll see it!

00:13:09.820 --> 00:13:12.850
Those mobile suits in the rear,
go around to the left side of the mountain...

00:13:12.920 --> 00:13:14.580
...and outflank the enemy...!

00:13:45.490 --> 00:13:48.180
Why are you stopping in a place like this?!

00:13:48.460 --> 00:13:50.190
This water...!

00:13:50.260 --> 00:13:51.690
You mean this lake?

00:13:51.760 --> 00:13:53.160
It's not frozen.

00:13:56.700 --> 00:13:58.860
It could be a reservoir
for the Kilimanjaro Base.

00:13:59.040 --> 00:14:00.160
Reservoir?

00:14:04.870 --> 00:14:06.840
Kamille, let's dive in.

00:14:07.040 --> 00:14:08.010
<i>Yes, sir!</i>

00:14:08.350 --> 00:14:09.310
What?!

00:14:09.550 --> 00:14:10.840
Wh-What's that?!

00:14:18.050 --> 00:14:19.850
The Psyco Gundam!

00:14:21.020 --> 00:14:22.050
Psyco Gundam?

00:14:41.580 --> 00:14:43.210
<i>Could Four be alive?</i>

00:14:44.180 --> 00:14:45.670
<i>Four is...!</i>

00:14:46.420 --> 00:14:48.880
<i>No, Four isn't there.</i>

00:14:48.950 --> 00:14:51.550
<i>What is it with this Psyco Gundam?</i>

00:14:52.590 --> 00:14:54.680
<i>It's different from before.</i>

00:14:59.500 --> 00:15:01.230
<i>She's not there.</i>

00:15:01.830 --> 00:15:03.360
<i>It's a completely different team?</i>

00:15:03.430 --> 00:15:04.400
<i>Kamille!</i>

00:15:04.500 --> 00:15:05.330
Y-Yes!

00:15:05.400 --> 00:15:07.170
<i>There seems to be a water pipe</i>
<i>in the back.</i>

00:15:07.240 --> 00:15:08.830
<i>You stay here while I look.</i>

00:15:12.940 --> 00:15:13.910
Lieutenant.

00:15:24.590 --> 00:15:26.520
<i>No, Four is not dead.</i>

00:15:26.790 --> 00:15:27.550
<i>She's alive.</i>

00:15:39.700 --> 00:15:41.140
Why did you follow me?

00:15:41.540 --> 00:15:43.200
Now, if we're both caught...

00:15:43.270 --> 00:15:45.240
...our mobile suits
will become property of the Titans.

00:15:45.510 --> 00:15:48.410
I don't want to leave everything
in your hands.

00:15:54.420 --> 00:15:55.750
I smell oil.

00:15:57.390 --> 00:16:00.250
How could they dispose of the water
without purifying it?

00:16:00.320 --> 00:16:03.290
Can't complain. We wouldn't
have made it this far otherwise.

00:16:03.460 --> 00:16:04.430
What's wrong, Kamille?

00:16:06.600 --> 00:16:08.290
Don't you hear something?

00:16:14.040 --> 00:16:14.730
No.

00:16:14.800 --> 00:16:17.470
I hear someone yelling,
or more like screaming.

00:16:24.910 --> 00:16:26.880
What's this?!

00:16:50.710 --> 00:16:52.830
This intense thought wave is like...!

00:16:53.840 --> 00:16:56.000
Kamille! It's dangerous
for us to go any further.

00:16:56.210 --> 00:16:57.840
How can you be so sure?!

00:16:58.450 --> 00:16:59.750
I've experienced this.

00:16:59.820 --> 00:17:02.080
But we have to investigate,
don't you agree?

00:17:02.150 --> 00:17:03.410
I'm going.

00:17:03.490 --> 00:17:04.450
Kamille!

00:17:20.000 --> 00:17:22.560
- Is this it?
- Huh? No, sir!

00:17:22.640 --> 00:17:24.040
Increase the intensity!

00:17:29.410 --> 00:17:31.110
Is this all she's got?

00:17:31.180 --> 00:17:33.770
We've entered the red zone
of the Psycho-wave.

00:17:33.850 --> 00:17:35.370
It would be dangerous to increase it further.

00:17:35.550 --> 00:17:37.520
I'm suggesting the opposite!

00:17:37.650 --> 00:17:38.620
Sir?

00:17:38.860 --> 00:17:42.290
If it makes her suffer like this,
she'll be no use to us.

00:17:45.730 --> 00:17:47.060
Okay, turn it off!

00:17:49.700 --> 00:17:52.830
I understand that it's a brainwave control, but...!

00:17:52.900 --> 00:17:55.530
We'd need several times the power
for remote control!

00:17:55.610 --> 00:17:56.800
I know that.

00:17:57.110 --> 00:18:00.170
But such demands would
destroy the pilot's body!

00:18:02.480 --> 00:18:04.840
Is it the same with real Newtypes?

00:18:05.150 --> 00:18:07.910
It's fine as long as she controls
it directly from the cockpit.

00:18:08.280 --> 00:18:09.550
I guarantee it.

00:18:09.650 --> 00:18:11.420
Of course it is!

00:18:14.320 --> 00:18:16.020
- It's gone!
- What?

00:18:16.090 --> 00:18:18.390
The thought waves were coming
from this direction.

00:18:25.540 --> 00:18:26.500
Jamitov!

00:18:39.450 --> 00:18:41.110
Damn Jamitov!

00:18:48.390 --> 00:18:49.360
Jamitov!

00:18:50.160 --> 00:18:51.130
<i>Jamitov?</i>

00:18:51.730 --> 00:18:54.130
<i>So this is the man who killed</i>
<i>Commodore Blex.</i>

00:18:54.500 --> 00:18:57.960
I wouldn't have expected you here
in my wildest dreams, Char.

00:18:58.030 --> 00:18:59.520
Or rather... Lieutenant Quattro.

00:19:00.370 --> 00:19:01.560
You're unlucky.

00:19:01.640 --> 00:19:02.970
You think so?

00:19:10.680 --> 00:19:12.150
You locked it!

00:19:14.480 --> 00:19:16.650
The Red Comet has hit rock bottom.

00:19:16.720 --> 00:19:18.450
What a place for you to die.

00:19:18.520 --> 00:19:20.550
I guess I overestimated you.

00:19:27.700 --> 00:19:28.660
Four?!

00:19:28.900 --> 00:19:30.490
It's you, Four!

00:19:33.870 --> 00:19:34.800
Four!

00:19:34.870 --> 00:19:36.240
I know!

00:19:36.370 --> 00:19:38.030
Testing in the cockpit is easy.

00:19:38.270 --> 00:19:39.610
Four, it's me!

00:19:39.680 --> 00:19:40.840
Kamille Bidan!

00:19:42.180 --> 00:19:43.150
Kamille!

00:19:43.380 --> 00:19:44.350
Four!

00:19:49.350 --> 00:19:52.250
- Why won't it open?!
- Only Four can open that door.

00:19:52.320 --> 00:19:53.850
Get in from the outside!

00:19:54.320 --> 00:19:55.590
Four! Can't you hear me?!

00:19:55.960 --> 00:19:57.260
It's me, Four!

00:19:57.330 --> 00:20:00.520
I know, I know!
I must go out to fight, right?

00:20:01.360 --> 00:20:02.920
Stop it! She's not hearing you!

00:20:03.000 --> 00:20:04.360
I'll make her remember!

00:20:04.470 --> 00:20:06.160
Kamille! Move over!

00:20:06.240 --> 00:20:07.200
Lieutenant!

00:20:08.300 --> 00:20:10.300
You mustn't get close to her!

00:20:10.370 --> 00:20:12.430
You know that she's
a Cyber-Newtype, don't you?!

00:20:12.740 --> 00:20:14.510
What difference does that make?!

00:20:16.110 --> 00:20:17.940
You'll be possessed by that girl!

00:20:18.010 --> 00:20:20.240
Let's talk before you go to fight, Four!

00:20:25.490 --> 00:20:26.460
Lieutenant!

00:20:26.820 --> 00:20:28.810
Four doesn't understand anything
at the moment!

00:20:28.890 --> 00:20:30.520
I just need to make her understand!

00:20:30.590 --> 00:20:32.150
If she's a Cyber-Newtype...

00:20:32.230 --> 00:20:34.660
...then she's being forced to fight
through some form of mind control!

00:20:34.730 --> 00:20:36.260
All we need to do is fix that!

00:20:36.630 --> 00:20:38.460
We don't have to kill her!

00:20:39.140 --> 00:20:40.100
Kamille!

00:20:42.310 --> 00:20:44.970
- Four!
- Don't go!

00:20:45.610 --> 00:20:47.470
Look for the drain!
We're escaping!

00:20:47.540 --> 00:20:48.440
Four!!

00:20:52.250 --> 00:20:54.580
Any word from the mobile suits
that arrived from space?

00:20:55.320 --> 00:20:56.580
<i>Nothing yet.</i>

00:20:56.650 --> 00:20:59.090
<i>They must've been shot down.</i>

00:21:02.590 --> 00:21:04.120
That's the Psyco Gundam!

00:21:12.030 --> 00:21:13.160
I won't let you!

00:21:19.080 --> 00:21:20.800
Why, that's Kamille and Char!

00:21:23.310 --> 00:21:25.470
Four! Get out of the Psyco Gundam!

00:21:25.920 --> 00:21:29.610
What did I tell you! Enemy mobile suits
have arrived, just as I thought!

00:21:36.260 --> 00:21:37.420
Stop! Four!

00:21:40.200 --> 00:21:41.630
Can't you tell?! It's me!

00:21:43.400 --> 00:21:44.700
So it's you, after all!

00:21:44.770 --> 00:21:47.290
I must continue to suffer
all because of you!

00:21:51.110 --> 00:21:52.230
Stay back, Kamille!

00:21:52.310 --> 00:21:53.470
I'll kill you!

00:21:56.110 --> 00:21:57.140
Move away!

00:21:57.210 --> 00:21:58.810
That Psyco Gundam's dangerous!

00:21:58.950 --> 00:21:59.810
Amuro!

00:22:04.950 --> 00:22:05.720
We're pulling back!

00:22:06.020 --> 00:22:07.650
FOUR!!

00:22:09.460 --> 00:22:10.950
I'm surprised that <i>you</i> came.

00:22:11.230 --> 00:22:13.060
How about Kamille?

00:22:15.260 --> 00:22:17.360
Why didn't you stop those two
from getting together?

00:22:18.230 --> 00:22:20.130
Are you talking about that girl, Four?

00:22:21.440 --> 00:22:23.560
I'm sure you're aware
of the consequences.

00:22:23.740 --> 00:22:26.540
Do you plan on letting the same thing
happen again?

00:22:47.270 --> 00:22:49.600
Oh, I can't help believing you

00:22:50.480 --> 00:22:56.020
kanarazu aeru to ano hi kara shinjiteita

00:22:50.480 --> 00:22:56.020
I've believed we're sure to meet again ever since that day

00:22:56.070 --> 00:23:01.400
kitto yobiau kokoro ga areba

00:22:56.070 --> 00:23:01.400
If we have heart, we'll be called together again

00:23:01.450 --> 00:23:11.790
mugen no Energy yobisamasu

00:23:01.450 --> 00:23:11.790
Awaken the infinite energy

00:23:11.830 --> 00:23:17.420
aa kizutsukeau mae ni

00:23:11.830 --> 00:23:17.420
Before you get hurt

00:23:17.460 --> 00:23:23.510
dekiru koto sagashite Please

00:23:17.460 --> 00:23:23.510
Find what you can do...Please

00:23:23.550 --> 00:23:28.680
nagedasanai de kurushii toki koso

00:23:23.550 --> 00:23:28.680
Don't throw it away because of this painful age

00:23:29.390 --> 00:23:32.020
itsuka mita aoi sora wo

00:23:29.390 --> 00:23:32.020
Until the day we gaze up again

00:23:32.030 --> 00:23:39.030
kitto anata to miageru hi made

00:23:32.030 --> 00:23:39.030
at the blue sky we once saw

00:23:46.620 --> 00:23:50.350
Four is unable to separate herself
from the Psyco Gundam.

00:23:50.730 --> 00:23:54.960
Moreover, even while held
in Kamille's arms...

00:23:55.030 --> 00:23:59.330
...she doesn't understand the
tragedy of her own fate.

00:23:59.400 --> 00:24:02.390
The rebirth of humanity
is still a long way off.

00:24:02.470 --> 00:24:07.030
Next on Mobile Suit Zeta Gundam,
"Forever Four".

00:24:07.460 --> 00:24:12.440
Next Episode

00:24:07.460 --> 00:24:12.440
Forever Four

00:24:07.680 --> 00:24:10.050
You will see the tears of time.
